      "needs_support": true,
      "support": "partial",
      "supporting_ids": [
        "PMC9586648::webcard"
      ],
      "same_system": "no"
    },
    {
      "text": "At approximately 1273 K, the Mo-doped alloy will increase yield strength or compressive strength by more than 10% relative to baseline TiVNbTa.",
